{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"closer\": \"Y\",\n  \"x_off\": [\n    \"S07：把亲密幸福的重要性转向了自己是否被对方需要、能否让对方安心，增加了被需要和提供陪伴的关系需求。\",\n    \"S09：把失去亲密的恐惧具体化为对方不再需要自己的陪伴，主线偏向自身价值和被需要感，而非亲密本身的消逝。\",\n    \"S11：疼痛的落点是对方以后是否还愿意接受自己的陪伴，变成了对关系回应不确定性的担忧，没有直接落在幸福时光留不住上。\",\n    \"S13：反复围绕能否得到对方不变的保证、是否该隐藏自己的需要展开，使核心冲突偏向寻求关系安全感。\"\n  ],\n  \"y_off\": [\n    \"S13：仍借助对方以后是否需要自己来表现失去亲密的恐惧，带有一些被需要与关系安全感的次级顾虑。\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"Y 更直接地让亲密带来的幸福与留不住它的痛楚相互推动：越珍惜亲近，越感到时间流逝、害怕失去；幸福本身也因此带着痛感。X 则多次把这份痛楚收窄为害怕不再被需要、害怕失去对方的接纳，主线部分转向了关系中的自我价值与安全感。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "491f6307-52dc-41e2-9088-061c11651707", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T102011022595Z", "elapsed_seconds": 15.5, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T10:20:26.531044+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "a14a421bb13d24386e6940c4e014a4c63a86661a90ea77f465ccde8d420a602b", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9